  "name": "Creality Ender-3 V3 KE toolhead (K1-style hotend with ceramic heater, dual 4010 side blowers in front shroud, CR-Touch behind nozzle)",
  "provenance": "Creality Ender-3 V3 KE toolhead (K1-style hotend with ceramic heater, dual 4010 side blowers in front shroud, CR-Touch behind nozzle) Confidence: medium. Sources: https://www.printables.com/model/976562 (RicoFD, 'Gantry E3V3 KE-Gantry (Mostly Complete).step': KE toolhead on MGN9 X rail + X brace); https://www.printables.com/model/969663 (RicoFD, KE hotend assembly with KE_Shroud, ceramic heater, dual 4010); https://github.com/CrealityOfficial/Ender-3_V3_KE_Klipper config/F005/printer.cfg [bltouch] x_offset 0, y_offset 27 (cross-check of probe position). Measured on RicoFD's community KE gantry assembly (model axes = printer axes, front=-Y); tip = lowest point of 'K1-nozzle'. Hotend is the K1-style nozzle + ceramic heater; tip to sock 4.91 mm. Shroud duct outlets are two lips left/right of the nozzle starting 6.0 mm above the tip at |x|~11-17 and rising outward/forward (stepped boxes in parts). CR-Touch sits directly behind the nozzle (CAD y=27.5; Creality cfg y_offset 27). CAD shows it deployed (-2.4 mm); stowed pin 2.3 mm is an estimate (BLTouch rule 2.3-4.3 mm, lower bound). Modelled MGN9 carriage block in the source is not aligned with the head in X; a derived carriage box centred on the head is added instead. Nozzle: land radius 0.50 mm, 31.6-degree cone to Z=2.60, then the nozzle parts as recorded. Gantry: X beam underside 52.80 mm above the tip, Y 20.0..45.0, every X. Converted by scripts/nonplanar_heads/open_heads.py from research/head-envelopes/creality-ender3-v3-ke.json (2026-10-13). Nozzle-tip frame +X right, +Y rear, +Z up, mm. Body axial/lateral margins 0.3 mm. Not calibrated.",
